<title>CHINA: Innovative ends talks on HK Toy Centre.</title>
<headline>Innovative ends talks on HK Toy Centre.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innovative International (Holdings) Ltd said on Friday it had suspended preliminary talks with United Pacific Industries Ltd about acquiring a stake in Hong Kong Toy Centre International Ltd.</p>
<p>Innovative said it had &quot;discontinued such discussions&quot; but gave no further details.</p>
<p>Hong Kong Toy Centre had said earlier its 74.7 percent controlling shareholder United Pacific was in preliminary discussions with third parties for sale of control of the company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
